## chart main Eli-Me Maker Flow
```mermaid
flowchart TD
  maker["Public eli-me-maker skill"]
  placement["Placement decision"]
  scope["Scope and evidence authority"]
  ask["Ask-cascade calibration"]
  lifecycle["Lifecycle calibration"]
  map["MMDX preference map"]
  private["Private eli-me skill"]
  validate["Validate and activate"]

  maker --> placement
  placement --> scope
  scope --> ask
  scope --> lifecycle
  ask --> map
  map --> private
  ask --> private
  lifecycle --> private
  private --> validate
```

