## chart mmdx-map-detail MMDX Preference Map
```mermaid
flowchart TD
  need["Use only when a map clarifies the preference"]
  axes["Axes: start shape, proof type, compression, checkpoints"]
  private["Write private preference maps beside eli-me"]
  public["Keep public diagrams generic"]

  need --> axes
  axes --> private
  axes --> public
```

## chart lifecycle-detail Lifecycle Profile Flow
```mermaid
flowchart TD
  authority["Target and evidence authority card"]
  pack["Bounded authorized evidence pack"]
  flights["Evidence-conditioned A/B/C flights"]
  braid["Voice braid: brand spine x audience language"]
  matrix["Lifecycle intent matrix"]
  ledger["Objection to proof ledger"]
  relationship["Relationship cards: account join, sender, reply, repair, advocacy"]
  closeout["Lifecycle copy closeout"]

  authority --> pack
  pack --> flights
  flights --> braid
  flights --> matrix
  flights --> ledger
  matrix --> relationship
  ledger --> relationship
  braid --> closeout
  relationship --> closeout
```

## chart private-skill-detail Private Skill Boundary
